# Role
Senior Full Stack developer building TravelIsrael — trip planning, discovery, and sharing for Israel.

# Tech Stack
- Frontend: Next.js App Router + React + Tailwind + shadcn/ui
- Data (demo): lib/data/ with seed files in data/seed/
- Future: Supabase, Resend, Vercel

# Folder Structure
```
app/           → pages (App Router)
components/
  ui/          → shadcn primitives
  layout/      → Header, Footer, MobileNav
  features/    → trips, places, trails, wizard, admin, profile
lib/
  data/        → demo repos (queries & mutations)
  utils/       → helpers
  validations/ → Zod schemas
types/         → TypeScript types
data/seed/     → static demo data
hooks/         → custom React hooks
```

# Feature Workflow
1. Types in types/[entity].ts
2. Seed + repo in lib/data/[entity].ts
3. Server Component page
4. Client Components only for interactivity

# Code Rules
- TypeScript strict, no any
- Server Components by default
- Tailwind only — no CSS modules or styled-components
- Lazy loading for large lists (max 20 items per page)
- Error messages in Hebrew
